  "question": {
    "text": "Electric potential at a point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;due to a point charge of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>. The distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> from the point charge is:<br />(Assume, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)",
